OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain will push northwards during the
OL,7,Fevening, heavy at times. Drier and
OL,8,Fclearer conditions returning from the
OL,9,Fwest around dawn. Breezy around the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA dry and bright morning
OL,13,Fwith some good sunny spells. Bright
OL,14,Fspells and a few showers through the
OL,15,Fafternoon and evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
